{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_7_level_main_07-04_end",
  "groupId": "main_7",
  "stageId": "main_07-04",
  "title": "Side By Side-2",
  "storyCode": "7-5",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "18ee26ef80b51d07b696a76b579543fcc607d7e59df789d0c096a7dfab0a363d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6:00am"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "We won't have much time after we take out that recon team.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "You're right. We're on a tight schedule.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "The operators aren't going to climb into the city from the sand.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Um... we do that sometimes.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But the core city is on the move. It will be hard to get into the foundation levels.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "If the operators stand on the sand and wait for the city to pass over them, both height and speed are going to be an issue.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "If they can't open the maintenance hatches and waste chutes on the underside, our distraction and our camouflage won't be worth anything.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "So our five teams will take a vehicle and use the cover of the sandstorm to approach the city, then employ special equipment to climb into the city superstructure.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "We only sent five teams?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "We're in no hurry to get the attention of the local Ursus brass.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "And we wouldn't want them to send out an attack ship to smash Rhodes Island in the wilderness and kill our employees.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Even if they did that, you wouldn't see a single report on it in any newspaper. The bankers and insurance executives will quietly cross out your name and shove all the lucre into their own nest eggs.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "No one will speak of you. No one wants to upset Ursus.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Our neutrality gives us some freedom to move in the cracks between forces, and that means we can't be backed by any power.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "We survive by working in secret. Just like when we sent those teams to save you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Five teams. Leave tracks, cover the tracks; objective complete, objective failed. No matter what, Rhodes Island only ever deploys five teams.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "But more teams means more firepower!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Even if they're not enough?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Even for a city-state like Lungmen, wiping us out would be a trifle.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "You saw the L.G.D. They're as strong as any country's special forces. They certainly have a pharmaceutical company beat.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "So why do they need us?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Because this is about the Infected.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Rhodes Island has departed Lungmen, and we're bearing on the next trade port at fifteen kilometers per hour.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "We'll be in the wilderness for a few weeks before we get there.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Aside from some nearby Rhodes Island communications specialists and some trusted vessels, no one will pick up our signal. We'll plot a course around all the nomadic cities' known paths.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Even if Lungmen decides to betray us, they won't be able to find us.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "But that's not enough, is it?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "We need more oomph!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Need to be sharper.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "We must have more to stake.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Right. We will need something else to tip the scales.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "The both of you turned pretty gloomy, huh?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I know how serious this is, but you don't have to... smile like that, do you?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Amiya... did I smile?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I know you did. Your lips may not have moved, but I could feel it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "So here we are.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...Yay!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "No, I have to say this: I do not intend to rebuild any sort of relationship with this person.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Heh. The feeling is mutual.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "You may be forgetting there's two sides to this.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "*Sigh*...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Myself, Amiya, and three of our elite operators will lead the five teams.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "We have three combat teams, one recon team, and one spec ops team.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "You may want to meet the leader of one of those teams.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Rosmontis! Wait!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "Oh... Blaze.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "You're badly wounded. Why are you here? You should go back. Go on.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Are you going to sortie this time?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "Yes.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "I'll get someone to replace you. How about Misery? He's better at assault ops than you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "He'll wave his hand and it'll be all done. Let's have him go.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "You don't want me to go?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Yeah. You shouldn't.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "You're giving me a weird feeling, Blaze.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "This isn't like the missions you went on before!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "Because I might die?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Watch it!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "You can't just... like... you can't just come out and say it like that!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "You're too young for such a dangerous mission. It's not right!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "But Amiya's going too.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "That's because she...! She's...!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "She's...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Amiya...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "She's just like me. She's Infected. She's an operator.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "And I checked the logs. Ace and Scout are both in Chernobog. They didn't come back.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "That means they're gone.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "I want to see. I want to know what happened. I want to see who's running Reunion. I want to know who did what.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "I want to know what happened to Ace and Scout.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Rosmontis? You don't have to record... that kind of stuff.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "...Blaze?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Shit. What the hell am I saying...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "No, sorry, I shouldn't have said that. Damn my big mouth!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "But, their deaths... They...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "Blaze.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "I'm the one who's wrong. We have happy memories, and painful ones too. You have to remember them both.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "You're weird, Blaze. Your words are all scattered and broken.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "...I don't want to see you hurting so much. Why do you have to look back at them? You... you can let go of those memories.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "You can put them there, leave them there, and don't look back.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "If I don't look... then what's the point in recording them?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "If I don't look... then they're forgotten.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "I won't forget. I definitely won't forget a single death.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Ha. Right. You're like me. You're a Rhodes Island elite operator.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "I can't go in your place. Really, I...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Nng... ugh...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "You're bleeding again?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "It's fine.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "I'll take you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Oof.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Rosmontis... You and Amiya look after yourselves.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "Right. I will.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Do I have to? Meet her...?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Dr. {@nickname}...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Rhodes Island's elite operators, for whatever reason, dedicate their talent and energy to the Rhodes Island project.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "The teams they bring with them fully support their work. Because our elite operators, to a certain degree, can directly determine how we use a certain tactic.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But not all of them are... exactly as we imagine them.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "You've met Elite Operator Blaze, Doctor. There are a lot of rumors about her, maybe you haven't heard. The truth is, they're a little exaggerated.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But everyone has a different impression of her.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But Doctor, I think... I think you're capable of understanding her choices.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Judging by your reaction, you may have already met the one we're talking about.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Oh? Huh...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Then... we're okay?",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Anything else I should know?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "That's the basic plan. Honestly, um... it's practical. A plan's a plan, an operation's an operation.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "But the op is what matters. A plan is just a basic outline of an operation. And a misstep during an operation can shatter a plan.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I hope we don't have any bad omen specialists here.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Engineering Operator",
          "text": "Uh oh... that ain't good! We have a problem!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Engineering Operator",
          "text": "Dust density is still too low. This isn't going to work with that light angle.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Engineering Operator",
          "text": "We're in the open here! If they look down from the bridge, they might spot us before we're fully operational!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
          "text": "But we can't cover the machine any more than it already is. If we block the airflow, we won't get enough of a current going to kick up the dust!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Engineering Operator",
          "text": "What do we do? Should we keep moving back...? We might not have time!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "text": "...I'll take care of it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "text": "Firewatch, keep an eye out, and tell me which way to adjust.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Firewatch",
          "text": "Lady? What... are you doing?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "text": "Fixing the angle of the light",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "text": "To mitigate the suffering of the world... I believe even the sun itself will bow to me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "Oh? Who's that on the dune? Nearl? They're not saddling up and not falling back?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "What's she doing? Meditating? Posing... is she posing here?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "...No, wait, what's that light? Her whole body is glowing... No, uh oh! Too bright!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "Um, thanks, Captain...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "Thanks for covering my eyes, but it would be great if you weren't squeezing like you wanted to crush my skull.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "What is Nearl doing?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "She's okay? Well... you say that, Captain, but that light is brighter than the sun. What is she up to?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "Huh? No way... she's pulling in all the light around us?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "Woah.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "Captain, all the light is starting to form together.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "I know. I'm just saying, could anyone but the Radiant Knight do something like this?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "Captain, look at the shadows of the sand dunes. Can you even tell what time of day it is?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "*Sigh*... I'm just trying to brighten the mood here. And once we kick up that sandstorm, we won't be able to see the shadows, right?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elysium",
          "text": "Shutting up. Sorry.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "text": "Take us up! We've got some weird-colored balls clipping us!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pilot",
          "text": "Don't be scared, Instructor. Reunion casters aren't good enough to shoot us down.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "text": "We're just a distraction, no need to put on an air show for Reunion!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pilot",
          "text": "Put on a good enough show and Reunion might just surrender, huh?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pilot",
          "text": "Isn't that what they call a show of force?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "text": "Aerial acrobatics isn't a show of force!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pilot",
          "text": "Hold on tight, Instructor!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "text": "—I need a barf bag!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "text": "The device is fully functional! Amiya, we're ready to move!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Roger!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Drivers, maintain a steady speed! Check your maps. Use the sandstorm to cover your approach to the core city until you're in range to deploy boarding gear! Engage!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "The sand will cover our tracks. Remember your protective gear, and don't let sand into our sensitive equipment!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But... I can see the sun. Why is the sunlight breaking through the sandstorm?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "The underside of the core city is so clear, it's like... Arts.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "This wasn't... part of the plan. Is that natural light?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "text": "...Don't worry about it!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Roger that! Grappling hooks, prepare to fire! Operators, make sure the cables are securely fixed to the underside of the city!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Once all our operators are aboard, the vehicles will depart at once! I don't usually say things like this, but I'm pretty sure that light just now is a good omen for us!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "text": "...Definitely!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "text": "(I made it a little too intense and had to aim it at the ground, but let's not tell her that part...)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "text": "Hold on, the core city is speeding up?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "text": "Our machines are wind-driven, but they can only keep the sandstorm up within a one kilometer range! If they break that range, they'll spot us for sure!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Hurry up, everyone!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pilot",
          "text": "We're out of time! We have to slow down!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pilot",
          "text": "If we drive out of the sandstorm,, Chernobog's optical detection system will pick us right up and blow the whole op!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pilot",
          "text": "How many people do you have left? Hurry up and...",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
